{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">下周一是已故前國家主席江澤民100周年誕辰，央視今日起播出關於江澤民的紀錄片。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">央視節目表顯示，CCTV-1台綜合頻道，今日起一連六日播出關於江澤民的十二集紀錄片，每晚八點播出兩集。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">而江澤民位於江蘇揚州的故居，早前則被中央宣傳部列為全國愛國主義教育示範基地。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.MEMORIAL-1800_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026ZbqPbF593P1786452374.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.MEMORIAL-1800_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T13:00:33.660042+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}